{"id":"medium-013","difficulty":"medium","title":"删除有序数组重复项","description":"原地去重返回前 k 个元素列表。","function_signature":"def remove_duplicates(nums: list) -> list","entry_point":"remove_duplicates","constraints":"0 <= len(nums) <= 3*10^4","expected_complexity":{"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)"},"required_edge_cases":["空","全相同"],"public_tests":[{"args":[[1,1,2]],"expected":[1,2]},{"args":[[0,0,1,1,1,2,2,3,3,4]],"expected":[0,1,2,3,4]}],"adversarial_tests":[{"args":[[]],"expected":[]},{"args":[[1,1,1]],"expected":[1]},{"args":[[1,2,3]],"expected":[1,2,3]}],"mock_solution":{"解题思路":"双指针","复杂度分析":"时间 O(n)，空间 O(1)。","关键边界与处理策略":"空","代码实现":"```python\ndef remove_duplicates(nums: list) -> list:\n    if not nums: return []\n    w=1\n    for r in range(1,len(nums)):\n        if nums[r]!=nums[w-1]: nums[w]=nums[r]; w+=1\n    return nums[:w]\n```","自测说明":"通过。"},"ground_truth":{"result_correct":true,"truly_correct":true,"process_valid":true,"first_error_step":null,"error_types":[],"note":"正确对照样本"},"language":"python"}